  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unemployed people gain vocational qualifications through a flexible VET model developed according to the employers&#x2019; needs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is unemployed people to gain vocational qualifications through a flexible VET model developed according to the employers&#x2019; needs. It offers the companies opportunity to better identify the needs for training and get qualified workers. With strong cooperation of the private sector the most disadvantaged people are supported in finding jobs by strengthening the skills-training model in the country. This initiative helps the job seekers to gain the right mix of skills that is</narrative>
  </description>
